all orbits of that strategy are eventually increasing odd sequences (x -> (3x+-1)/2), so N(X)=O(log X): the THEOREM's conclusion holds there trivially,
but sections 1.2 and 1.4 do not survive, contrary to the proof of the (withdrawn) Corollary 4.

